  "title": "Visual EEG Study (BrainVision → BIDS)",
  "description": "This dataset contains high-density EEG recordings collected during a visual stimulation task. Data were converted from BrainVision format (.vhdr/.vmrk/.eeg) to the EEG-BIDS specification, with a single session per participant. No acquisition-time filters or offline preprocessing are included.",
